{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39206","headline":"代书寄马 · 韦庄","name":"代书寄马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驱驰曾在五侯家，见说初生自渥洼。\n鬃白似披梁苑雪，颈肥如扑杏园花。\n休嫌绿绶嘶贫舍，好着红缨入使衙。\n稳上云衢千万里，年年长踏魏堤沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}